) applies for tax years 2018 through 2025 and expires beginning in 2026.</p><p></p>","updateDate":"2025-03-25T14:12:25Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"SALT Deductibility Act","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-09-19T23:07:29Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-09-19T23:07:29Z"}
